    "b-ks2-path-epoch-intro": {
      "id": "b-ks2-path-epoch-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "EPOCH BOUNDARY — Retired 2026-09-02. The boundary phase no longer exists as a librarian phase. Its "
        },
        {
          "insert": "regression",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " pathway was replaced by the deterministic integration record on the run row ("
        },
        {
          "insert": "worker_run.integration",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "integration_detail",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", with conflict paths, shown to the next worker on its card — no event row, no task). Its "
        },
        {
          "insert": "drift_recheck",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " pathway was replaced by the Drift Gate inside the pr_imported and run_closed passes: report reconciliation still runs whenever the checkout head moves — rename continuity via "
        },
        {
          "insert": "target.moved_to_id",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " — and enqueues nothing; the flagger's report rides in the pass context; the consumer's gate allows one retry. The manual job kg2-drift-scan is the only remaining producer of "
        },
        {
          "insert": "drift_recheck",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " tasks, one per unit."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
